talking through Zoom.

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:10.343
So, the singing
whisper challenge,

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:14.747
since you're a great singer and
since we're doing this on Zoom,

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:17.349
what we're going to do is --
one of us will mute

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:19.352
