that we've assigned you,

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.023
and I don't know what it is.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:25.158
And you don't know what I have.

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:26.459
And we'll have to guess what

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.494
