just by reading their lips.

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:30.730
Does that make sense?
-Okay. Alright, got it.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.465
-I'm going to mute.
Should I mute now?

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:35.235
-Yeah.
-Here comes the mute.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:36.536
