00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.972
I can't hear you.

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:42.242
-Can you not hear me?
[ Laughs ]

00:00:42.242 --> 00:00:45.011
Sorry. Okay. Okay. Alright.

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:48.214
Okay. Oh, okay. Ready?
Here we go.

